{"sections":[{"slug":"主丛","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"主丛"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">主齐性空间</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"主齐性空间, 主丛"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">主齐性空间</span></strong> (principal homogeneous space), <span lang=\"zh\">又称</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">旋子</span></strong> (torsor), <span lang=\"zh\">是一个</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">忘掉了单位元在哪里的群</span>”. <span lang=\"zh\">对于群</span> $G$, <span lang=\"zh\">一个</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主齐性空间是一个带有</span> $G$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/群作用","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">作用</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span> $P$, <span lang=\"zh\">且满足其商</span> $P / G$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个点</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴语境中这等同于说作用是自由且</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/传递作用","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">传递</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>).</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当我们谈论的对象是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">于一个基底空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的丛</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">或</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">主齐性空间又称为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span></strong> (principal bundle). <span lang=\"zh\">对于群</span> $G$, <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛是</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上一个带有</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">作用的对象</span> $P\\to X$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足其商</span> $P / G$ <span lang=\"zh\">就是</span> $X$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛在</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">局部</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">上是</span> $G$, <span lang=\"zh\">但不一定有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/整体截面","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">整体截面</span>"}},{"Plain":"; <span lang=\"zh\">有整体截面的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛即同构于平凡</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中可以谈论群和主丛</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">主齐性空间</span>); <span lang=\"zh\">这涵盖了所有</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的概念</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的主丛的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分类空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分类空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}G$; <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathbf{B}G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的映射同伦类又称为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/非Abel上同调","text":"$1$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶非</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">上同调类</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">意象中的主丛</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛即是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/终对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">终对象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的态射</span> $1\\to\\mathbf{B}G$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义对象</span> $X\\in\\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/俯意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">俯意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal X_{/X}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这相当于</span> $\\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的态射</span> $X\\to \\mathbf{B}G$, <span lang=\"zh\">给出如下拉回图</span>,\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    P &amp; \\to &amp; 1 \\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\n    X &amp; \\to &amp; \\mathbf{B}G\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">因此</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛也即</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">在某对象</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群作用","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">作用</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">且使得商</span> $P/G$ <span lang=\"zh\">等价于</span> $X$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">注</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">一般而言</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛会共享</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的许多拉回稳定的性质</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">例如当</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $0$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断对象时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">映射</span> $1\\to \\mathbf{B}G$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $0$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断映射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">从而其拉回也是</span> $0$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断映射</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这意味着</span> $0$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断对象</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛的全空间也是</span> $0$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也就是落在</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span> $\\mathcal X_{\\leq 0}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">上述定义中</span> $\\mathbf{B}G$ <span lang=\"zh\">也可替换为任意的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$, <span lang=\"zh\">通过</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/常值层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">常值层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子视为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的下降</span>,\n$$\r\n\\mathcal X_{/A}\\simeq \\operatorname{lim}_A \\mathcal X =\\mathsf{Fun}(A,\\mathcal X),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">态射</span> $1\\to A$ <span lang=\"zh\">等同于函子</span> $P\\colon A\\to \\mathcal X$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $\\operatorname{colim}_{a\\in A}P_a\\simeq 1$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">一般范畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">要想在一般的范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">如拓扑空间的范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">流形的范畴</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">中定义主丛</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">只需要将其嵌入到一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/层意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">再使用意象中的主丛的定义</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">不过需要注意</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}G = * / G$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及一般的商</span> $X / G$ <span lang=\"zh\">可能不再是原来范畴的对象</span>.</p>\n<h3>$1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的具体情形</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $(1,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可以用更简单具体的资料来定义群的主齐性空间</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">每个</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">作用都给出</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的一个</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但要使得基底空间</span> $X / G$ <span lang=\"zh\">落在原来的</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">就需要加</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">自由作用</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的条件</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">使用</span> Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上同调的计算</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于覆盖</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的满射</span>) $U\\to X$, <span lang=\"zh\">由于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Giraud公理","text":"Giraud <span lang=\"zh\">公理</span>"}},{"Plain":", $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Čech脉","text":"Čech <span lang=\"zh\">脉</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何实现(单纯图表的余极限)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nX \\simeq \\operatorname{colim} \\text{\\v{C}}(U\\to X),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">故对象</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的主丛可表示为</span> $\\text{\\v{C}}(U\\to X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的主丛</span>:\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}(X,\\mathbf{B}G) \\simeq \\operatorname{lim} \\big(\\operatorname{Hom}(U,\\mathbf{BG})\\rightrightarrows \\operatorname{Hom}(U\\times_X U,\\mathbf{BG})\\cdots\\big).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">由此</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可用</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/非交换Čech上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">非交换</span> Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">计算</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">主丛的同构类等信息</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">有限群的主丛</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于离散拓扑群</span> $G$, <span lang=\"zh\">其主丛等同于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Galois覆叠","text":"Galois <span lang=\"zh\">覆叠</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关资料</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/PB∞T","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">意象中的主丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}